---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<p class="tagline">沼田課長と愉快な部下たちの投資記録</p>
	<a href="https://x.com/numasoko_value" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-x" aria-label="X（旧Twitter）をフォロー">
		<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
		<span>@numasoko_value をフォロー</span>
	</a>
	<nav class="footer-links" aria-label="サイト情報">
		<a href="/about#owner-info">運営者情報・免責事項</a>
		<span aria-hidden="true">・</span>
		<a href="/privacy">プライバシーポリシー</a>
	</nav>
	<p>&copy; {today.getFullYear()} 沼底バリュー商会. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		padding: 2em 1em 4em 1em;
		background: var(--accent-dark);
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}
	.tagline {
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
		margin-bottom: 0.3em;
	}
	p {
		margin: 0.2em 0;
	}
	.footer-x {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4em;
		margin: 0.5em 0;
		padding: 0.4em 0.9em;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
		border-radius: 20px;
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.85em;
		transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
	}
	.footer-links {
		margin: 0.6em 0 0.4em;
		font-size: 0.85em;
	}
	.footer-links a {
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
	}
	.footer-links a:hover {
		color: white;
		border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
	}
	.footer-links span {
		margin: 0 0.5em;
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
	}
	.footer-x:hover {
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
		border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
		color: white;
	}
</style>
